@startuml
title GET /users - List Users (Admin Only)

participant "Client" as C
participant "API Gateway / Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "UserController" as UC
participant "IUserService" as US
participant "IUserRepository" as UR
participant "[DB]" as DB

C -> Auth: GET /users?role=X&active=true&limit=Y&offset=Z \nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
activate Auth
Auth -> Auth: Validate Token
Auth -> Auth: Check Admin Role
Auth -> UC: Forward Request
deactivate Auth
activate UC
UC -> US: ListUsers(roleId, active, limit, offset)
activate US
US -> UR: FindUsers(roleId, active, limit, offset)
activate UR
UR -> DB: Execute SELECT query (filtered)
activate DB
DB --> UR: User Records
deactivate DB
UR -> UR: Map Records to List<UserModel>
UR --> US: List<UserModel>
deactivate UR
US -> US: Map List<UserModel> to List<UserDto>
US --> UC: List<UserDto>
deactivate US
UC -> C: 200 OK \nContent: List<UserDto>
deactivate UC

alt Error (e.g., Auth Failed, DB Error)
  Auth --> C: 401/403 Unauthorized/Forbidden
  UC --> C: 500 Internal Server Error
end

@enduml